    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nApartment 11, 115 Strand Road is a smartly laid out top floor, one bedroom apartment located on the ever so popular Strand Road in Sandymount with stunning sea views across Sandymount Strand. This apartment has been lovingly cared for by its current owner and provides a truly exciting opportunity for a discerning purchaser to acquire a beautiful home in a truly unrivalled location overlooking the seafront. No.11 is further boosted by a private car parking space.\n\nThe accommodation measures 52 sq m/ 560 sq ft approx. and briefly comprises of enterance, a newly installed well equipped kitchen in an open plan kitchen/living/dning with two large sash windows with sea views with high ceilings and a generous double bedroom and a spacious bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nThe property could not be more conveniently located, being just opposite Sandymount Strand and Sandymount village with its unique village atmosphere and excellent choice of shops, boutiques, and restaurants are within walking distance. Also, within a short walking distance are Sandymount and Sydney Parade DART stations which, combined with several bus routes, ensure easy access into and across the city. Just some of the other amenities close-by include the Westwood Leisure Centre, Claremont Tennis Club/Railway Union Cricket, Hockey, and Football Club, the RDS, the InterContinental Hotel, Aviva Stadium, St Vincent's University Hospital, and the Merrion Shopping Centre. Many of Dublin's premier schools and several universities are also within easy reach. St Stephen's Green and the IFSC are within a short drive and Dublin Airport is only 15 minutes away via the Dublin Port Tunnel."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWith store\n\nLiving/Kitchen/Dining - 4.58m x 6.86m\nWith carpet floor, two large sash windows with attractive sea views, and impressive high ceilings, this elegant space also includes a gas fireplace and a newly installed kitchen complete with ample wall and floor units and integrated appliances.\n\nBedroom - 4.58m x 2.74m\nDouble bedroom with carpet floor and sash window with sea views.\n\nBathroom - 2.14m x 2.74m\nWith tiled floor and stand alone bath with shower head, wash hand basin and w.c.\n\n"
      },
